exists su name src-c8c76d37aed405f7d6ad6392f2724da0d58f73e79c45486148e579129370b73b ob text quoted.text.# Widget API

The widget service exposes a stable HTTP endpoint.

## Configuration

Set PORT to 8080 before starting the service.

```sh
widget --port 8080
```
